  "description": "Dependency-free imaging library for .NET, with no native dependencies at all. Reads and writes animated PNG (APNG); decodes PNG, JPEG, GIF and BMP; resizes with premultiplied-alpha filtering. RGBA at 8 or 16 bits per channel. Trimming and NativeAOT safe.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
