  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Adds ZlibCompressor, so a caller can supply its own zlib compressor, such as ZopfliSharp, for files typically 6-9 % smaller: ApngWriterOptions.Compressor covers every IDAT and fdAT, and new PngCodec.Encode, EncodeFile and EncodeToArray overloads cover still images. The library still has no dependencies, and without a compressor its output is byte-for-byte unchanged.",
